#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Virtual threads, for real this time"
msgstr "虚拟线程，这次是真的"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus 4 is coming, and one key decision was raising the Java baseline to 21. This post explains why."
msgstr "Quarkus 4 即将发布，其中一项关键决策是将 Java 基准版本提升至 21。本文将解释其中的原因。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Let's be clear: nothing is wrong with Java 17!\n"
"Where we are heading as a framework is what really matters."
msgstr "让我们说清楚：Java 17 本身没有任何问题！真正重要的是，作为框架，我们未来的发展方向是什么。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Java 21 is the first LTS with virtual threads. Quarkus 3 already supported them, but through reflection hacks to avoid depending on the Java 21 API (https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/56328[here's what that looked like]). This is hard to maintain, it leads to suboptimal performance, and we need a convoluted fallback. Worse: virtual threads felt like second-class citizens; not every extension was tested with them."
msgstr "Java 21 是首个支持虚拟线程的 LTS 版本。Quarkus 3 虽然早已支持虚拟线程，但当时是通过反射技巧实现的，以避免依赖 Java 21 API（ link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pull/56328[具体实现方式如下] ）。这种做法难以维护，会导致性能不佳，而且我们需要一个复杂的备用方案。 更糟糕的是：虚拟线程似乎被当作“二等公民”对待；并非所有扩展都经过了与虚拟线程的兼容性测试。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "All of this changes with Java 21 as the baseline. No reflection, no conditional paths. We can test virtual threads support in each extension easily and catch issues before you do. As an application developer, you keep using simple, blocking APIs, and get the scalability benefits from virtual thread."
msgstr "以 Java 21 为基准，这一切都将发生改变。不再需要反射，也不再需要条件路径。我们可以轻松测试每个扩展对虚拟线程的支持情况，并在您遇到问题之前就将其发现。作为应用程序开发人员，您可以继续使用简单的、阻塞式的 API，同时享受虚拟线程带来的可扩展性优势。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If you're an extension writer: expect a much simpler path to support virtual threads."
msgstr "如果您是扩展程序开发者：支持虚拟线程的过程将变得简单得多。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The ecosystem is moving"
msgstr "生态系统正在发生变化"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "We're not early. Projects are already dropping Java 17:"
msgstr "我们并不算早。已有项目开始放弃使用 Java 17："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://errorprone.info/docs/installation[Error Prone] requires Java 21"
msgstr "link:https://errorprone.info/docs/installation[Error Prone] 需要 Java 21"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://www.jenkins.io/doc/book/platform-information/support-policy-java/[Jenkins CI] no longer supports Java 17"
msgstr "link:https://www.jenkins.io/doc/book/platform-information/support-policy-java/[Jenkins CI] 不再支持 Java 17"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://jena.apache.org/download/index.cgi[Apache Jena 6] requires Java 21"
msgstr "link:https://jena.apache.org/download/index.cgi[Apache Jena 6] 需要 Java 21"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "https://jakartaee.github.io/platform/jakartaee12/JakartaEE12ReleasePlan[Jakarta EE 12] sets Java 21 as the platform baseline. Each spec can decide to stay on 17, but none can go higher than 21. If Quarkus 4 started at 17, we'd need a mid-lifecycle bump to adopt these specs. That's exactly what we want to avoid."
msgstr "link:https://jakartaee.github.io/platform/jakartaee12/JakartaEE12ReleasePlan[Jakarta EE 12] 将 Java 21 设为平台基线。各规范可选择维持在 17 版本，但均不得高于 21 版本。如果 Quarkus 4 从 17 版本起步，我们将在生命周期中期需要进行版本升级才能采用这些规范。而这正是我们希望避免的。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The clock is ticking for Java 17"
msgstr "Java 17 的时间正在流逝"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "When we started discussing this change, some community members said, \"Java 17 is EOL, no-brainer.\" The reality depends on your JVM vendor; support ends in 2027 or 2029. But Quarkus 4 will be around for several years, which takes it past those 2027 or 2029 dates. We wanted to be ahead of these cut-offs, not chasing them."
msgstr "当我们开始讨论这一变更时，一些社区成员表示：“Java 17 已到生命周期结束（EOL），这根本不用多想。” 实际情况取决于您的 JVM 供应商；支持期限将在 2027 年或 2029 年结束。但 Quarkus 4 还将存在数年，这意味着它的生命周期将超过 2027 年或 2029 年这些截止日期。我们希望领先于这些截止日期，而不是被它们追着跑。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "A leaner build matrix"
msgstr "更精简的构建矩阵"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Quarkus currently tests against Java 17, 21, and the next LTS preview. It's a lot of machine time and a lot of cost. Dropping 17 means two LTS versions instead of three. With Java 29 on the horizon, keeping Java 17 would mean four versions. It's not a sustainable number of variants."
msgstr "Quarkus 目前针对 Java 17、21 以及下一个 LTS 预览版进行测试。 这需要大量计算资源，成本也很高。放弃 Java 17 意味着 LTS 版本将从三个减少到两个。随着 Java 29 的临近，若继续支持 Java 17，则将导致需要支持四个版本。如此多的变体数量是不可持续的。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Why not Java 25?"
msgstr "为什么不是 Java 25？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Great question. Our usage data still shows strong Java 21 usage. Java 25 has benefits, but Quarkus already supports it, including FFM, without a hard dependency. Native compilation uses Mandrel 25 regardless."
msgstr "问得好。我们的使用数据仍显示 Java 21 的使用率很高。Java 25 确实有其优势，但 Quarkus 已经支持它（包括 FFM），且不存在硬依赖。无论如何，原生编译都会使用 Mandrel 25。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "What changes for you?"
msgstr "对你来说会有什么变化？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Not much. Java 21 usage (blue) is growing; Java 17 (green) is declining. Quarkus 4 is heading where our community already is. The first RC is planned for the end of September."
msgstr "没什么特别的。Java 21（蓝色）的使用率正在上升；Java 17（绿色）的使用率则在下降。Quarkus 4 的发展方向与我们社区当前的状况一致。首个候选版本（RC）计划于 9 月底发布。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "**If you're on 21+, nothing changes. If you're on 17, now is a good time to plan the move.**"
msgstr "*如果您使用的是 21+ 版本，一切照旧。如果您使用的是 17 版本，现在正是规划升级的好时机。*"
